2026-09-05  DEVIATION, recorded while h17b was still running and before h17
  or h17a had started. Measured throughput fell from the 28.6 conditions per
  second the specification's budget assumed (35 milliseconds per condition)
  to 18.2 conditions per second, because the four shared cores were carrying
  a load average of 4.9 from the other agents. Extrapolating the full
  pre-registered grid at that rate gave about 2 hours of further computation
  on top of the 1 hour 50 minutes already spent, which risks the five-hour
  target. Two whole settings were therefore dropped from the two batteries
  that had not yet started, never any items, as section 7 of the
  specification requires:
    (a) the position mode `all_no_bos` was dropped from H17 and from H17a,
        leaving `all` and `last` for H17 and `all` alone for H17a. That mode
        differs from `all` only in whether the single prepended
        beginning-of-text token is patched.
    (b) the number of control seeds was reduced from three to two for H17
        and H17a. H17b keeps all three. Two seeds still give 168 control
        trials per setting for H17 and 248 for H17a.
  H17b was unaffected and ran the full pre-registered grid.
  Revised counts: H17 35,280 conditions (was 74,088), H17a 18,600 (was
  52,080), H17b 14,112 (unchanged).

2026-09-05  ERRATUM found and corrected during the run, before any result
  was read. The position of the swapped concept's first mention, used only
  by the H17b position mode `from_mention`, was computed one token too high.
  The cause: the offsets were taken from the plain Hugging Face tokenizer
  encoding, which does not prepend the beginning-of-text token, and then one
  was added to account for the prepended token, but the transformer_lens
  tokenizer used to read those offsets does prepend it, so the correction was
  applied twice. Fourteen of the sixteen items moved from position 2 to
  position 1, one from 5 to 4 and one from 8 to 7. Effect: the `from_mention`
  arm of the first H17b run began one token after the concept's first token
  instead of at it. The other two H17b position modes, `all_no_bos` and
  `answer_only`, were unaffected, and no other battery uses the mention
  position. The first H17b run was stopped at roughly 9,000 of its 14,112
  conditions, its partial records were discarded unread except for a
  pipeline check, the position finder was rewritten to walk the model's own
  token strings, `battery_h17b.json` was rebuilt (only `first_mention_pos`
  changed; every other field is byte-identical), and H17b was queued to run
  again in full after H17a.

